sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant GW as API gateway
    participant Rt as Router
    participant Srv as Inference server
    participant KV as KV cache
    participant GPU as GPU
    U->>GW: prompt
    GW->>Rt: authenticate, apply quota
    Rt->>Srv: route to a replica with capacity
    Srv->>Srv: tokenise, add to the running batch
    Note over Srv: continuous batching — new requests join between steps, they do not wait for the batch to drain
    Srv->>KV: allocate cache for this sequence
    loop each generated token
        Srv->>GPU: forward pass
        GPU->>KV: read and append attention state
        GPU-->>Srv: next token
        Srv-->>U: stream it out
    end
    Srv->>KV: release the blocks
    Note over KV,GPU: KV cache is the real capacity limit — it grows with sequence length times concurrency
